%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dHey, Yoshimura! I'm so glad to see you here!\d%K%P
「哟，芳村君！\n来了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dChief Hiragi! It's been too long!\d%K%P
「平木科长！\n久疏问候！」%K%P
And so, on my first day at work...%K%P
在第一次上班的这一天…%K%P
I made my way through the nostalgic route to the office\nwith a somewhat fresh feeling in my heart, and as I --\nstill somewhat nervous -- passed through that familiar\ndoor, I was welcomed by...%K%P
带着崭新的心情走过令人怀念的路上，\n紧张地打开办公室门，出来迎接我的人是…%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\d\dToo long\d, he says. It's barely even been a month.\nReally, though... I'm glad to see you. I really am.\d%K%P
「也没那么久吧，大概只是一个月没有见面。\n但是…太好了。真的、太好了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dChief...\d%K%P
「科长…」%K%P
...my considerate accomplice from that long-gone time.%K%P
是那个时候，和我一起当共犯的令人怀念的那张脸。%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dI will never forget the night of the typhoon. I truly am\nsorry about what happened. I hope you have it in your\nheart to forgive me.\d%K%P
「台风那一天的事，我一直没有忘记啊。\n那时真是非常抱歉…请原谅我」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dP-Please, don't think too much about it. All I did was\nget you involved in my crazy schemes.\d%K%P
「怎、怎么会…请不要在意。\n科长只是被卷入了我的暴走吧」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\d...Well, I can't really argue with that. The stress\nmust've taken ten whole years off my life in a fortnight\nafter that little occurrence.\d%K%P
「…嘛，虽然的确是这样。\n从那以后的半个月，我的寿命缩短了１０年呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「…对不起」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dHahaha, still the constant apologizer, eh? And here I\nthought you were a conniving little bastard who saved our\nsorry-ass company from certain doom.\d%K%P
「哈哈哈，你还是老样子，总是道歉呢。\n明明是将我社从解散的危机中拯救出来的英雄呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, uh, I think that's quite an exaggeration. Plus, I got\nsacked from the company before I could even take concrete\naction.\d%K%P
「不，那只是过大的评价。\n结果我还不是在事情发生之前就被赶出去了吗」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dI really wish you could've seen the looks on those\nexecutives' faces when I showed them your little plan...\d%K%P
「将你的报告给各部的科长看时他们那惊异的表情…\n真想也给你见识一下啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dStill, it was quite incredible you managed to partner up\nwith the Sawashima Group in such a short time. Even I\nconsidered that part to be a little unrealistic.\d%K%P
「不过话说回来…\n真亏能在那么短的时间内就做到提携这一步呢。\n说实话，我都感觉不可能了」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dYeah, well, the phrase \dcompulsory investigation\d seems\nto have done its job. The company was still in quite a\nstate of chaos last week.\d%K%P
「『强制搜查』这一关键词出人意料的有效呢。\n嘛，虽然上周几乎是鸡飞狗跳的情况吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can imagine...\d%K%P
「是这样吗…」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dWe still have employees who are against the merger,\nespecially the real estate division. I mean, they were\neach other's biggest rival until just now.\d%K%P
「现在也是，公然反对泽嶋的人也有不少。\n不管怎么说仍然还是有抗拒的啊，特别是房地产那边」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
After all, Michihama was established only to support\nMitsumaru from the shadows, which, if anything, must have\ndespised Sawashima.%K%P
毕竟一直以来三丸房地产都是作为泽嶋房地产的宿敌而存在，\n三丸房地产几乎就是为了与泽嶋竞争而存在的组织。%K%P
I doubt there were many people who could just switch sides\nlike that in a few days, at least emotionally.%K%P
仅仅在十天的时间里，\n对他们说『以后就为了宿敌公司而努力工作吧』\n这样的话，会真的接受并努力的人才是稀有人种吧。%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dWell, you don't need to worry about that for now. The\nothers don't really know it was you who turned this\ncompany upside-down.\d%K%P
「嘛，总之你不需要在意这些事。\n别人到现在都还不知道是你推翻了这家公司呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dO-Okay...\d%K%P
「哈、哈啊…」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dOn the other hand, I ended up getting too much credit and\nam now overestimated, which is a real mixed blessing.\d%K%P
「嘛，归功于此，我在好的方向和不好的方向\n都对你作出了非常大的评价呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「不、不敢当」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\d...I'm starting to feel like your head is bowed more\noften than it is raised. But then you go and tear the\ncareers of our executives to shreds.\d%K%P
「…话说回来，你还是这么喜欢低头哈腰啊。\n我怕你这样会被部长吃掉的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-It's not like that...\d%K%P
「所、所以说…」%K%P
I was glad my other peers didn't know much about my\ninvolvement, but the fact that the person currently in the\nspotlight overestimated my abilities to this extent\nstarted to unnerve me a little.%K%P
虽然别的员工们不会对我过高评价，\n可是，他们全员所敬畏的科长\n对我如此过高评价，想想就感觉恐怖。%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dWell, good luck in your future endeavors, Yoshimura. I\nwill do everything in my power to support you.\n...Especially now that we're getting more business.\d%K%P
「嘛、总之努力吧芳村君。\n如果有我能做到的事，我会尽可能的帮你的。\n…不过也要多斟酌一些啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'll do my best! I'll make sure that every fiber of my\nbeing works to serve the company under your wise\nleadership, Chief!\d%K%P
「好、好的，我会努力的！\n在下芳村理，会在平木科长的名下，\n为了会计部鞠躬尽瘁死而后已…」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dU-Uhh, about that... You aren't actually in the\naccounting department anymore.\d%K%P
「啊、啊啊…关于这件事呢。\n其实你新的所属部门不是会计部」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Excuse me?\d%K%P
「…什么？」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...There's a new supervisor coming?\d%K%P
「…董事长秘书？」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dAs you know, our company has cut its ties with Mitsumaru,\nand as of the start of September, they are officially\nmerged with the Sawashima Group.\d%K%P
「如你所知，我们公司从九月开始，\n从三丸房地产的庇护下离开，置入到泽嶋房地产的旗下了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-Yes.\d%K%P
「是、是的」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dMiwa and Terakawa -- the managing directors that were\nassigned to us by Mitsumaru -- have been let go, along\nwith Chief Director Shinayama. They were all assigned to\nanother Mitsumaru subsidiary.\d%K%P
「原是三丸组的三轮专务和寺川常务被解雇。\n与专务派的篠山部长一起\n去了三丸别的子公司」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWait, does that...\d%K%P
「那就是说…」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dWell, that's all par for the course in a coup d'etat.\nIt's nothing for you to worry about.\d%K%P
「嘛，发生政变的话这也是很正常的。\n你不用在意」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
That was easy for him to say...%K%P
就算你说不用在意，这也…%K%P
I'd never met Managing Directors Miwa and Terakawa before,\nbut I'd spoken with Chief Director Shinayama on countless\noccasions.%K%P
虽然和三轮专务二号寺川常务都没有见过面，\n但和篠山部长是交谈过好几次的。%K%P
He wasn't exactly amicable towards me, and was also\ndirectly responsible for me being fired, but I didn't hold\na grudge against him. Especially since what he did was\ncompletely within the purview of his own job.%K%P
虽然经常对我说出很严厉的话，\n将解雇消息给我的也是他，\n但我与他并没有什么个人恩怨。%K%P
I hope I didn't end up ruining someone's life...%K%P
不用假设也可以肯定…\n我打乱了篠山部长的人生呢。%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\d...Let me continue.\d%K%P
「…我继续说了哦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Go on.\d%K%P
「…好的」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dSo, anyway, someone has to take those posts now. And\nvarious political matters come into that.\d%K%P
「然后，在考虑空出来的职位该让谁担当的时候，\n嘛，那自然是不能让外人来担当的职位呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSomeone from Sawashima will be coming here for that, is\nthat correct?\d%K%P
「从泽嶋来的派遣职员…是吧？」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dSince we're their subsidiary now, we've no option but to\ncomply. They'll be assuming office today, same as you.\d%K%P
「因为这边是子公司所以也没办法。\n正好，与你一样从今天开始就上任了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dH-Huh... Really now?\d%K%P
「哈、哈啊，于是呢？」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dI don't know where they've heard about you, but they\nrequested you as their secretary.\d%K%P
「虽然不知道从哪听来的消息，\n不过要指名你当自己的秘书呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Say what?\d%K%P
「…您说、什么？」%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dIt was certainly quite the surprise. I, of course, was\nplanning to call you back as soon as possible, but they\nwent ahead of me and requested you by name, even though\nyou weren't even a part of our company anymore.\d%K%P
『我也很惊讶啊…\n虽然我们自然会让你回来，\n但突然就单独指名了还没有进入公司的你呢』%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dI imagine you were quite famous within Kamata Trading\ntoo.\d%K%P
『你在镰田商事的时候果然相当的有名啊』%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dOh, please, spare me the modesty. If that wasn't the\ncase, how would Sawashima's executives know you by name?\d%K%P
『不不你也不用谦虚。\n否则的话泽嶋的要职也不会知道你的名字』%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dI personally regret that such an able subordinate won't\nbe under my wing, but...\d%K%P
『虽然对我来说，无法获得像你这样优秀的部下\n是很遗憾的…』%K%P
%LCVice Chief
%LC副部长
\dHonestly, I think this might be for the best. Plus, I\ndoubt I'd be able to properly handle someone of your\ncaliber anyway.\d%K%P
『但是，仔细想想这对你来说也许是好事。\n说实话，你在我手下是无法发挥全部能力的』%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
A supervisor from Sawashima... assuming office today...%K%P
从泽嶋来的派遣…\n今天开始上任…%K%P
...who knew of me by name.%K%P
而且…还知道我的事情。%K%P
It wouldn't be...%K%P
不会吧…%K%P
I-It couldn't be what I was thinking, right? That would be\nbeyond insane.%K%P
不会吧、不会吧、不会吧…\n不，那怎么可能…%K%P
But I couldn't think of anyone else who'd fit the bill.%K%P
但是，我也想不到别的人…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...This is Yoshimura Osamu. I was told I would be working\nhere starting today.\d%K%P
「…我是芳村理。\n从今天开始，请多多关照了」%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\d...Come in.\d%K%P
「…进来吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...!!\d%K%P
「～！」%K%P
Should've known it... There was absolutely no mistaking\nwho that voice belonged to.%K%P
果然…这声音…\n没有搞错。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo! What on earth have you done?!\d%K%P
「姬绪小姐！\n这到底是怎么一回事啊！？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫緒
\dInsolent as ever... I've already told you, do not call me\nby name when Toko isn't around.\d%K%P
「别叫得这么亲热…\n除非在小都子面前，否则不要直呼我的名字！」%K%P
